{"slug":"research/cyber-toolkits","title":"Cyber toolkits for LLMs \\ Anthropic","desc":"LLMs not fine-tuned for cybersecurity can succeed in multistage attacks on networks with dozens of hosts when equipped with a novel toolkit.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">LLMs with cyber toolkits can conduct multistage cyber operations on business-sized computer networks</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2025-06-13\">Jun 13, 2025</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Team</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/frontier-red-team\">Frontier Red Team</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=tool-use\">Tool use</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=safety-evaluations\">Safety evaluations</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=agents\">Agents</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=partnerships\">Partnerships</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button></li></ul></div></header><div class=\"EaEYjq_ContentWrapper\"><div class=\"EaEYjq_ConstellationPanelSlot\"><aside style=\"visibility: 